<div class="textwithmargins">
    <h2>Returns and Refund Policy</h2><br />
    Any faulty or damaged stock will be replaced at no charge.<br />
    Any orders received incorrectly through the fault of the seller, will be replaced at no charge.<br />
    Any orders received incorrectly through the Prescription lines ordered incorrectly by patient cannot be refunded or returned.<br /><br />
    Should you change your mind or you ordered the incorrect product, we will happily accept a return of a product for a refund or credit on the following conditions:
    <ul>
	    <li>Products that may be heat affected cannot be returned (e.g. film and some medications);</li>
	    <li>The item is received in its original condition (i.e. has not been opened, used, damaged);</li>
	    <li>The item is not a prescription, pharmacy medicine, vitamin or baby formula;</li>
	    <li>The item has been purchased via this site within the last 14 days; and</li>
	    <li>The customer must pay the return postage.</li>
    </ul>
    Please contact the seller on 08 9330 9356 and inform us of the product you would like to return with the reason for return and one of a staff members will advise you step by step of instructions of our returns process.
    <h5>Please do not send any items back until you have contacted one of our staff members.</h5>
</div>